{"baseRefName":"feat/vaiwl-hf-host-simulator-20261011","body":"## 最终云端交付（2026-10-11）\n\n**云端可执行审计、必要修复和完整回归已完成；总体 LIMITED，真实 IndexedDB/MV3 增量仍 BLOCKED。**\n\n- 最新交付 head：`cd9066b16cd76618b639779c7096cb514f015dd8`。\n- 最终已测试运行时代码：`8041f1dbfd3350b2cbead0651b04f9da6574a5ed`；之后只归档证据及修正文档。\n- Base 保持 PR #6 `a02d65388f0a5d09833ac8a7091a45dea1720f82`；本 PR 保持 Draft，未合并。\n- 没有修改 main、PR #1/#4/#5/#6、PAIA 或其他仓库，没有 Mac/DC、私人账户、真实 ChatGPT、付费服务或 GitHub Actions。\n\n## 已实现\n\n同一个B1 IndexedDB v1→v2，ConversationRef/UserSendEvent/来源/coverage/新鲜度/未知/冲突/撤销、30当地日历日投影；持久Workspace、Placement、人工锁/排除、派生标题/别名、图标/顺序/偏好、CAS/操作幂等/冲突感知撤销、检查点/显式恢复。管理界面复用PR #6导航，不重建宿主正文或输入。只有合成证据通道，标签不是生产认证。\n\n## 本轮真实运行\n\n| 证据 | 结果 | 边界 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Node全套 | **118/118 PASS，exit 0** | 数据库合同使用明确的mock-IDB |\n| Chromium DOM全套 | **49/49 PASS，exit 0** | 原48项完整继承+新P11；opaque/fake router/fake sender/mock-IDB，不是扩展认证 |\n| 实际原生IDB驱动 | BLOCKED，exit 2 | 导航管理员策略，在应用加载前拒绝 |\n| 正常URL页面集成 | BLOCKED，exit 2 | 同上 |\n| 实际Chrome MV3加载 | BLOCKED，exit 2 | unpacked extensions disabled by administrator |\n| 真实登录ChatGPT | NOT_RUN | 不在授权范围 |\n\nLinux 6.18.44 x86_64，Node22.16.0，Python3.13.5，Playwright1.57.0，Chromium144.0.7559.96。120主题/604引用、128成员大主题和160消息长聊天未缩水。原生三档各一次，遇政策限制停止，未绕过。PR #6过去Mac结果不算PR #7通过。\n\n## 新修复与既有修复复验\n\n新发现损坏view偏好导致完好Workspace读取失败；两个有效反例先FAIL，最小修复后PASS。现在只隔离损坏view、保留其字节并提示，主题和人工标题继续可用；没有放宽状态损坏、身份、CAS断言。新增P11证明浏览器原生节点/草稿保留。更早helper错误单列保留。\n\n5997ec0已有的撤权/提交后屏障、恢复不复活证据和旧receipt、journal revision高水位、时间UNKNOWN规则及MV3事件泵修正均已复验。最终118/49不累加此前116/48或独立子集。\n\n## 真实原始证据（已经入库）\n\n[最终报告与覆盖矩阵](https://github.com/haohongfei2001-png/Virtual-AI-Workspace-Layer/blob/cd9066b16cd76618b639779c7096cb514f015dd8/docs/engineering/B23_ACCEPTANCE_2026_10_11.md)\n\n[完整无损原始日志分片](https://github.com/haohongfei2001-png/Virtual-AI-Workspace-Layer/tree/cd9066b16cd76618b639779c7096cb514f015dd8/docs/engineering/b23-final-2026-10-11/raw-parts)\n\n[源码、版本及原始哈希](https://github.com/haohongfei2001-png/Virtual-AI-Workspace-Layer/blob/cd9066b16cd76618b639779c7096cb514f015dd8/docs/engineering/b23-final-2026-10-11/SOURCE_AND_RUNS.json)\n\n完整Node TAP、DOM每项expected/actual、失败前后原件、原生拒绝原件及退出码通过以下命令恢复，自动校验原始字节SHA256：\n\n```sh\npython docs/engineering/b23-final-2026-10-11/decode-evidence.py --out /tmp/b23-evidence-new\nnode --test tests/b1/broker.test.mjs tests/hf/*.test.mjs tests/b23/*.test.mjs\npython tests/b23/view-browser.py --browser /usr/bin/chromium --out /tmp/b23-dom-new\n```\n\n此前未交付的RAW_RESULTS.tar.gz引用已纠正。源码与最终DOM bundle匹配；分片传输逐blob核对，发现的不匹配在提交前修正。\n\n## 未放行及下一条件\n\n持久化是实际IDB代码，不是内存实现；但真实磁盘/刷新/多tab/worker增量尚未运行到业务断言，因此不能称全项工程验收通过。检查点恢复可能丢失最新人工修改；恢复后证据失效，不是无损备份。损坏view本轮隔离并提示，不重建偏好。真实账户resolver、历史/发送时间/导出/Project权限仍未解决。\n\n可以继续既定B4、C1及合成宿主内受限C2工程，不能放行生产C2/C5/C6/发布。补原生验收需要允许loopback/IndexedDB/unpacked MV3的独立Chrome环境，不必是用户Mac；未经另行授权不连接Mac。测试命令见tests/b23/README.md。本轮交付至此停止，不自动合并或开下一模块。","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-10-11T01:33:31Z","authors":[{"email":"haohongfei2001@gmail.com","id":"U_kgDOE3jmkg","login":"haohongfei2001-png","name":"hongfei hao"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-11T01:33:31Z","messageBody":"… B1 database","messageHeadline":"feat(b23): persist evidence, workspaces and manual intent on existing…","oid":"ea034db5ea792b210ffcf66fc25acead10ab1751"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-11T04:09:39Z","authors":[{"email":"haohongfei2001@gmail.com","id":"U_kgDOE3jmkg","login":"haohongfei2001-png","name":"hongfei hao"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-11T04:09:39Z","messageBody":"…erified claims","messageHeadline":"docs(b23): checkpoint interrupted work and separate evidence from unv…","oid":"cbcde633777ec7c463ddce3f6f1b888fa61f0cfe"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-11T04:35:04Z","authors":[{"email":"haohongfei2001@gmail.com","id":"U_kgDOE3jmkg","login":"haohongfei2001-png","name":"hongfei hao"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-11T04:35:04Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"test(b23): checkpoint actual cloud origin and MV3 policy blockers","oid":"ced74f1be1ad07b7732290ebc28e8178898d90c7"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-11T04:47:07Z","authors":[{"email":"h